      "cooked": "<p>If a target temporarily receives the trait of industructable and is reduced to 0 HP, what happens to it when that trait is removed? &nbsp;It is instantly destroyed? &nbsp;This seems \"right\" but I'm playing with Unity in the Time Cataclism and \"Fixed Point\" was just played. &nbsp;If all her Bee Bots get destroyed they'll just hang out until \"Fixed Point\" is discarded and then go off at once?</p>",
