      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-09T22:27:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Once the indestructible trait is gone, any target with 0 or fewer HP is destroyed in the order the players choose. If some of those targets are multiple Bee Bots, the players will destroy them one at a time, thusly triggering the effects in that order.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Of course, one at a time. &nbsp;Good catch. &nbsp;(I knew that even though I wrote \"at once\".)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
